 Sat_7pm_COUPLES_REEL_c2-timeout\n(captions: instagram.txt\, facebook.tx
 t\,
  threads.txt)\n\nInstagram caption:\nWhen your heart is racing\, you
  can't
  really hear each other. Nothing productive happens past that poi
 nt.\n\nSo
  stop. Twenty minutes.\n\nThe rule: either one of you can call
  it. No stor
 ming off\; say when you'll be back. And then come back\, ev
 ery time.\n\nA 
